meta {
  name: payment-gateway
}

docs {
  Money-out endpoints of `PaymentGatewayResource` (`operations/controller/PaymentGatewayResource.java`).
  Payouts debit the calling user's VAHN wallet and send a RazorpayX payout. For the full vendor
  payout journey, see `bruno/flows/plutus-api/vendor-payout/`.
}
